                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "As a game, it's fine. Few typos, but overall a solid but short visual novel, though maybe not worth full price. My main greviance and reason for a non-recommendation is the uncensored version of the game. Face it, you're probably here because of the girl in lingerie wielding a chainsaw. The fact that there's an uncensored patch available may have caused you to drop some cash on it (or at least pick it up in a Humble Bundle like myself).\n\nHere's the thing: the sex scenes are AWFUL. Short, EXTREMELY poorly written, and numerous typos and other technical issues (like the text being attributed to the male character when it should have been the girl). As I put on my thread in the discussions page (before it was deleted), the writing for those scenes is comparable to an elementary school student writing about what he thinks sex is like. That, or someone spent maybe 10 minutes whipping up the text when the artist revealed he made some nude CGs.\n\nIf you're going to go with the sex sells route in marketing, at least make damn sure you don't treat it like an afterthought.\n\nTLDR: Looking for a short fun romp, grab this on sale. Looking to choke your chicken, AVOID. There are other games out there that can do it better.",
